<attribute name="sectionName" nodeId="ce00b3de"></attribute>
<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="ff152538">The number of resources dedicated to testing varies depending on the scope breadth and depth. Additionally, the complexity
level in the target solution may impact not only the number of resources allocated to the test effort but also which
resources are needed to test certain aspects of the target solution. Discuss with stakeholders the resources needed to
provide an appropriate amount of coverage for the test effort.</attribute>
