<attribute name="sectionName" nodeId="394e2f32"></attribute>
<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="382916ab">&lt;p&gt;
    Participating members create an effort estimate for each test level and test type performed with considerations to the
    resources available for the entire test effort.&amp;nbsp;These estimates are accumulated to determine the estimates for the
    whole project. Estimates are used as the basis for planning the test effort. Assumptions used for each estimate are
    also documented.
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
