<attribute name="name" nodeId="90e30119">Outline an approach for managing test data</attribute>
<attribute name="guid" nodeId="4287fe0e">_rapqAJK1EeSEOeG-bGncjA</attribute>
<attribute name="presentationName" nodeId="64b9c87c">Outline an approach for managing test data</attribute>
<attribute name="briefDescription" nodeId="487e7118"></attribute>
<attribute name="suppressed" nodeId="df12a005">false</attribute>
<attribute name="orderingGuide" nodeId="fdf1e354"></attribute>
<attribute name="variabilityType" nodeId="4a1138fc">na</attribute>
<attribute name="sectionName" nodeId="b01f43ec"></attribute>
<attribute name="sectionDescription" nodeId="4c45d343">&lt;p&gt;
    Discuss with stakeholders a strategy for obtaining and managing test data. A primary consideration for obtaining test
    data is whether to use generated or production data. Other considerations to discuss include:
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Defining a process to request and obtain test data
    &lt;/li&gt;
    &lt;li&gt;
        Defining how test data is copied into test environments
    &lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</attribute>
